DaidaGuard GTM Tag Template
Injects the DaidaGuard Greenfield Bootloader and asynchronously loads the Singleton browser SDK.

Registry interface:
  window.__DAIDA_GUARD__.pendingConfigs = [{ orgId, accountId, dataLayerName }]
  window._dlvDebugMode = true  (when debugMode is enabled)

GCS schema bundle path is constructed automatically by the SDK:
  https://cdn.daidalytics.com/schemas/{orgId}/{accountId}/bundle.js

SDK path:
  https://cdn.daidalytics.com/sdk/latest/dlv-sdk.min.js